WEBVTT

01:31.264 --> 01:33.984
[Episode 6]

01:33.984 --> 01:36.680
[A Bright Mirror Hung High]

01:36.680 --> 01:39.959
I, Meng Ting Hui, accuse Huiyuan An Ru Lan

01:39.959 --> 01:41.359
of stealing my policy essay.

01:41.359 --> 01:43.159
I beg you, Prefect, to deliver justice.

01:43.159 --> 01:46.480
Confucius said,
"Think thrice before you act."

01:46.480 --> 01:49.040
Then he added, "Twice is sufficient."

01:49.040 --> 01:53.719
You spread this essay across the capital,
causing a huge uproar.

01:53.719 --> 01:54.920
Do you have any proof?

01:54.920 --> 01:58.200
You can summon An Ru Lan
to court for a confrontation.

01:58.200 --> 02:02.799
Prefect, she gathered all those commoners
outside here.

02:05.079 --> 02:06.200
Summon Huiyuan An.

02:38.199 --> 02:40.800
I'm Huiyuan An Ru Lan. Greetings, Prefect.

02:41.800 --> 02:43.439
Huiyuan An, no need for such formalities.

02:43.439 --> 02:47.360
The seat for the Huiyuan is ready.
Please be seated.

02:47.360 --> 02:50.120
Jiang Mei Er, what are you doing here?

02:53.919 --> 02:54.960
Second Master,

02:54.960 --> 02:56.759
it was that wretch, Meng Ting Hui.

02:57.520 --> 02:59.599
She harmed my uncle and Mr. Feng.

03:00.879 --> 03:04.599
I wish I could tear her flesh
and sleep on her hide.

03:09.360 --> 03:11.199
Where is she now?

03:11.199 --> 03:15.000
She won the top candidate and will soon
head to the capital for the exams.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.439
I have a way to deal with her.

03:18.080 --> 03:19.639
Second Master, by helping me,

03:20.439 --> 03:22.560
you'll be ridding Master of a true menace,

03:23.360 --> 03:24.680
which is a great deed.

03:32.639 --> 03:34.400
As long as you help me,

03:38.879 --> 03:40.879
I will be yours.

03:52.240 --> 03:55.919
This fellow student is talking nonsense.
Have you lost your mind?

03:57.840 --> 03:58.879
Prefect, please judge fairly.

03:59.719 --> 04:01.479
This woman's real name is Jiang Mei Er.

04:01.479 --> 04:03.599
She is the niece
of the former Governor of Shazhou.

04:03.599 --> 04:06.080
She was my classmate
at the Shazhou Women's Academy.

04:06.080 --> 04:08.560
Back in Shazhou, she never studied,

04:08.560 --> 04:11.000
acting tyrannically
and bullying our classmates.

04:11.000 --> 04:13.840
She might deny it
now that she has changed her name,

04:13.840 --> 04:17.560
but since she won the Huiyuan title,
she must have real knowledge.

04:17.560 --> 04:22.120
Prefect, I request to debate the classics
with Huiyuan An on the spot.

04:26.360 --> 04:27.879
Why have you all come here today,

04:28.519 --> 04:30.560
if not to seek justice?

04:30.560 --> 04:32.279
Then let us all see together

04:32.279 --> 04:33.959
how much real knowledge this Huiyuan

04:33.959 --> 04:36.639
of the Imperial Exam for Women
actually possesses.

04:36.639 --> 04:37.639
Well said!

04:37.639 --> 04:39.959
- We want to see real knowledge!
- Real knowledge!

04:39.959 --> 04:41.560
- We want to see real knowledge!
- Real knowledge!

04:41.560 --> 04:42.959
We want to see real knowledge!

04:44.360 --> 04:49.519
Good. I, too, favor those
with real knowledge.

04:51.560 --> 04:52.879
When a nation prospers,

04:52.879 --> 04:54.079
it tends to its people as wounded.

04:54.079 --> 04:55.079
That is its blessing.

04:55.680 --> 04:57.040
When it perishes,

04:57.040 --> 04:58.680
it treats the people as dirt and weeds.

04:58.680 --> 04:59.759
That is its ruin.

04:59.759 --> 05:02.000
Does this quote come from the Book of Rites
or the Book of Documents?

05:08.680 --> 05:10.519
It is the Book of Rites.

05:13.920 --> 05:15.920
No, it's the Book of Documents.

05:20.879 --> 05:22.759
It's the Zuo Commentary.

05:22.759 --> 05:25.399
I just misremembered. That's all.

05:25.399 --> 05:27.399
What can these few words prove?

05:29.120 --> 05:30.319
Did you all hear that clearly?

05:31.319 --> 05:33.519
It's a classic text that all scholars
in the world know,

05:33.519 --> 05:35.199
yet she quibbles,
saying she misremembered it.

05:35.199 --> 05:38.600
How could such a contradictory person
be the Huiyuan?

05:38.600 --> 05:41.120
Has the Ning Empire's Imperial Exam
become a child's game?

05:41.120 --> 05:42.120
Well said!

05:42.759 --> 05:45.040
Well said!

05:45.040 --> 05:46.839
Well said!

05:46.839 --> 05:49.879
Prefect, the Huiyuan's policy essay
was not written by her at all.

05:50.480 --> 05:52.160
I beg you to judge fairly.

05:52.160 --> 05:54.399
Confucius said, "Knowing that you know--"

05:54.399 --> 05:55.560
Prefect,

05:55.560 --> 05:58.240
after ten years of hard study,
I finally achieved scholarly rank.

05:58.240 --> 06:00.279
And now she's framed me like this.

06:00.279 --> 06:02.319
You must uphold justice.

06:02.319 --> 06:04.399
Confucius said: "Watch a man's actions,

06:04.399 --> 06:05.399
examine his motives--"

06:05.399 --> 06:08.120
Prefect, she insists the Huiyuan's essay
came from her own hand,

06:08.720 --> 06:10.959
then why not retest her
on this essay right now?

06:10.959 --> 06:12.879
I'll take the test with her right here.

06:13.480 --> 06:15.800
One test will tell the truth from the lie.

06:15.800 --> 06:18.360
Prefect, there is no need for a test.

06:18.360 --> 06:21.160
In black and white, I wrote the essay.
There is no mistake.

06:21.160 --> 06:23.920
Can you both let me finish speaking?

06:23.920 --> 06:26.920
All this commotion is hardly proper.

06:26.920 --> 06:30.199
And this isn't the exam hall.
What's there to test?

06:30.199 --> 06:32.680
Do you really think that scholarly rank

06:32.680 --> 06:35.319
can be twisted by a glib tongue?

06:37.040 --> 06:38.360
Jiang Mei Er,

06:38.360 --> 06:40.720
I got rid of your uncle.

06:40.720 --> 06:42.759
You really think I can't do the same to you?

06:42.759 --> 06:45.199
You did not see how terribly your uncle died.

06:46.360 --> 06:49.560
A bolt to the heart, he died on the spot.

06:49.560 --> 06:50.879
Let me guess

06:51.759 --> 06:54.120
how you stole my Huiyuan title.

06:55.240 --> 06:58.160
Was it through your uncle's
pitiful connections,

06:58.160 --> 06:59.279
or

07:01.199 --> 07:03.800
did you make some shady deal?

07:05.079 --> 07:07.879
What you always care about most is your face.

07:09.279 --> 07:11.360
You boast of being the foremost beauty.

07:12.079 --> 07:13.800
Could it be that you relied on...

07:15.439 --> 07:17.160
As long as you help me,

07:18.680 --> 07:20.600
I will be yours.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.519
Shut your mouth!

07:27.240 --> 07:28.360
Meng Ting Hui!

07:29.759 --> 07:30.959
Order! Order!

07:30.959 --> 07:31.959
Madwoman!

07:33.319 --> 07:34.360
The trial is not over yet!

07:34.360 --> 07:36.279
Pull them apart! Court adjourned! Adjourned!

07:37.399 --> 07:38.560
The trial is not over yet!

07:43.279 --> 07:45.360
Meng Ting Hui!

07:45.360 --> 07:47.120
You took everything from me.

07:47.120 --> 07:48.560
I will kill you!

07:50.600 --> 07:53.079
Prefect, did you hear it clearly?

07:53.079 --> 07:54.519
Is the truth not clear enough?

07:56.879 --> 07:58.199
Guards,

07:58.199 --> 08:02.439
seize this fake Huiyuan
who has deceived the world.

08:16.839 --> 08:20.839
So you're all birds of a feather,
colluding in evil.

08:20.839 --> 08:22.160
In the Imperial Exam world,

08:23.160 --> 08:24.959
in the court of law,

08:24.959 --> 08:28.000
all I see are wolves
that devour people without mercy.

08:29.839 --> 08:31.720
Now you've finally figured it out.

08:32.799 --> 08:35.639
What a pity, it is far too late.

08:36.559 --> 08:40.200
Did you really think
those ignorant commoners could help you?

08:44.360 --> 08:47.240
In the end, you still fell into my hands.

08:47.240 --> 08:48.879
From now on,

08:48.879 --> 08:53.200
in the Imperial Exam for Women,
there will be no Meng Ting Hui anymore.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.600
In this world,

09:03.720 --> 09:04.879
the shameless

09:06.799 --> 09:09.200
live longer than the reckless.

09:09.200 --> 09:10.279
Meng Ting Hui,

09:11.440 --> 09:15.039
whether in Shazhou or the capital,

09:15.039 --> 09:20.759
I can easily destroy anything you cherish.

09:20.759 --> 09:21.759
I can destroy it!

09:27.960 --> 09:29.720
- Let go of me!
- Pull them apart!

09:29.720 --> 09:31.159
If I go down, you're coming with me!

09:35.519 --> 09:38.320
You disgrace scholarly decorum
in this very court!

09:39.039 --> 09:42.799
Confucius said, "Harmony is the essence
of proper conduct."

09:42.799 --> 09:44.080
Jieyuan Meng,

09:44.080 --> 09:48.480
you'd better confess
to the crime of falsely accusing the Huiyuan.

09:48.480 --> 09:51.200
I guarantee your life will be spared.

09:51.200 --> 09:53.840
Prefect, she has stirred up such a huge mess

09:53.840 --> 09:55.320
and nearly took my life.

09:55.320 --> 09:56.879
She must not be spared.

09:56.879 --> 09:59.360
Everyone already knows
about the real and fake Huiyuan.

10:00.519 --> 10:01.799
If something happens to me,

10:02.519 --> 10:04.679
it will only confirm
the truth of my accusation.

10:04.679 --> 10:07.360
Then will you still be able
to stay out of it, Prefect?

10:07.360 --> 10:10.759
Turn back now,
and you might still save your life.

10:12.000 --> 10:13.559
What a glib tongue.

10:13.559 --> 10:15.639
Prefect, arrest her immediately.

10:15.639 --> 10:18.639
Confucius said, "Do not govern
where you do not hold office."

10:19.480 --> 10:22.600
I have my own sense
of how to handle this case.

10:22.600 --> 10:24.240
No need for you to say more.

10:25.440 --> 10:26.519
Throw her in prison.

10:31.159 --> 10:33.559
Prefect, the Huxiao Gang is here.

10:55.799 --> 10:58.000
Second Master Lv and Huiyuan An.

11:09.200 --> 11:10.200
Come over here.

11:13.480 --> 11:17.080
Prefect Dong, how do you plan
to deal with Meng Ting Hui?

11:18.039 --> 11:19.519
I've already made arrangements.

11:20.240 --> 11:24.399
I'll spread the word that Meng Ting Hui
lost her mind after failing the exam

11:24.399 --> 11:26.080
and lock her up for a while.

11:26.080 --> 11:29.159
Once the dust settles,
I'll send her back to Shazhou.

11:30.000 --> 11:31.919
You're truly a good official.

11:33.399 --> 11:34.799
You flatter me, Huiyuan An.

11:34.799 --> 11:36.080
I believe

11:36.080 --> 11:40.480
that if we kill Meng Ting Hui,
it'll definitely cause a stir.

11:40.480 --> 11:42.799
I am doing this for the bigger picture.

11:46.240 --> 11:49.600
Second Master, look.

11:49.600 --> 11:52.320
He does not take you seriously at all.

11:52.320 --> 11:54.159
He is leaving himself a way out.

11:58.679 --> 11:59.879
Mei Er, rest assured.

12:01.919 --> 12:07.200
I've invited Prefect Dong's wife and children
for tea at the teahouse.

12:12.600 --> 12:15.519
W-Why did you do that?

12:16.879 --> 12:18.720
I have done as you instructed.

12:18.720 --> 12:19.919
What else do you want from me?

12:20.759 --> 12:21.879
I want to see Master.

12:27.559 --> 12:28.559
Master?

12:31.120 --> 12:33.080
Do you look down on me?

12:34.799 --> 12:40.120
Dong Shou Cai, without the Huxiao Gang,
you wouldn't be wearing this robe.

12:40.120 --> 12:42.080
How dare you put on airs in front of me?

12:43.919 --> 12:44.919
Do not forget,

12:45.799 --> 12:48.840
you haven't repaid
the court official debt yet.

12:48.840 --> 12:52.600
If Master finds out, you're as good as dead.

12:56.919 --> 12:59.000
So, Prefect, you'd better think carefully.

12:59.679 --> 13:03.440
Do you want glory and wealth

13:04.840 --> 13:06.799
or a torn-apart family?

13:09.240 --> 13:11.720
I'll leave it all to you two,
Second Master and Huiyuan An.

13:26.039 --> 13:29.679
All who participated
in the Imperial Exam fraud

13:29.679 --> 13:32.039
are to be detained pending trial.

13:32.679 --> 13:33.679
As you command.

13:35.279 --> 13:36.279
Take them away!

13:44.240 --> 13:47.480
Your Majesty, Zhi Li instructed me
to present this item urgently.

13:47.480 --> 13:50.519
It's a grievance petition
written personally by Meng Ting Hui herself.

13:50.519 --> 13:52.200
Countless copies have been made

13:52.200 --> 13:54.279
and spread across the capital's streets.

13:56.686 --> 13:58.320
[Petition of Grievance]

13:58.320 --> 14:01.759
She has lit this fire swiftly and fiercely.

14:01.759 --> 14:02.960
Where is she now?

14:02.960 --> 14:04.600
Capital Prefectural Office.

14:05.360 --> 14:06.399
To the Capital Prefectural Office.

14:39.240 --> 14:40.240
Jiang Mei Er,

14:41.840 --> 14:43.559
you had better kill me today,

14:44.639 --> 14:46.679
or I will make your life worse than death.

14:47.320 --> 14:48.679
Killing you now?

14:49.639 --> 14:51.120
How boring that would be.

14:51.120 --> 14:54.519
I want to torment you to death, bit by bit.

14:55.320 --> 14:58.559
I will make you repay ten thousandfold.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.559
Anything else you want to say?

15:12.360 --> 15:14.000
You deserved it.

15:14.000 --> 15:15.440
You shall die a thousand deaths.

15:15.440 --> 15:17.519
You will get your comeuppance
sooner or later.

15:30.799 --> 15:32.120
Her false accusation failed,

15:32.120 --> 15:33.399
so she took her own life.

15:33.399 --> 15:36.039
She burned the prison, and died in flames.
Understood?

15:36.039 --> 15:37.039
Yes.

17:06.599 --> 17:08.200
Still trying to run?

17:08.200 --> 17:09.359
Meng Ting Hui,

17:09.359 --> 17:11.480
you got over a hundred
of my Heihu Crew brothers killed.

17:11.480 --> 17:13.160
Today, you will join them in death!

17:16.119 --> 17:17.119
Meng Ting Hui!

17:21.359 --> 17:22.359
Meng Ting Hui,

17:23.240 --> 17:25.559
since fire cannot kill you,

17:25.559 --> 17:27.839
I will finish you off with my own hands.

17:34.720 --> 17:35.720
Fall back!

17:36.519 --> 17:38.119
Meng Ting Hui, you madwoman!

18:19.480 --> 18:20.480
She is there!

18:27.400 --> 18:28.519
I will kill you!

18:32.359 --> 18:33.359
Let's go!

18:35.000 --> 18:36.000
Get them!

18:57.720 --> 19:01.279
He Du, they tried to kill me.

19:03.519 --> 19:04.519
Leave it to me.

19:16.559 --> 19:18.240
I, Dong Shou Cai,

19:18.880 --> 19:20.400
studied hard for ten years

19:21.279 --> 19:24.039
and held myself to the ways of the sages.

19:24.039 --> 19:25.720
On the day I passed the Imperial Exam,

19:26.640 --> 19:30.752
I also swore before the mirror
to be an honest official.

19:31.392 --> 19:35.240
Yet I faltered
and strayed from the right path.

19:36.000 --> 19:39.119
I was timid and cautious for half my life.

19:40.079 --> 19:41.640
I deserve punishment for my sins,

19:42.440 --> 19:44.039
and I deeply regret it.

19:44.960 --> 19:46.680
I'm willing to atone with my death.

19:47.599 --> 19:49.359
But my family is innocent.

19:50.359 --> 19:51.640
I beg Your Majesty

19:52.880 --> 19:54.759
to show mercy.

20:02.068 --> 20:07.168
[Laws of Ning Empire]

20:20.279 --> 20:21.279
Miss Meng.

20:40.039 --> 20:42.400
Huiyuan Meng is nothing
but a common orphan girl.

20:42.400 --> 20:44.839
How did she get His Majesty
to personally intervene on her behalf?

20:46.039 --> 20:48.079
[Nine Nine Nine]
Many noble ladies from powerful families

20:48.079 --> 20:50.200
are eagerly longing for His Majesty's favor,

20:50.200 --> 20:51.720
yet they cannot even get a proper glance.

20:51.720 --> 20:54.119
But he pays her so much attention?

20:54.720 --> 20:56.960
His Majesty values the Imperial Exam.

20:56.960 --> 20:59.680
This is the first Imperial Exam
since His Majesty ascended the throne,

20:59.680 --> 21:01.400
yet it has encountered such fraud.

21:01.400 --> 21:04.759
His Majesty's action is a declaration
of his resolve to the realm.

21:04.759 --> 21:06.480
But she had no reason to enter the palace.

21:07.160 --> 21:09.240
Ever since His Majesty was a child,

21:09.240 --> 21:12.799
except for you, no other woman
has ever been allowed to stay in the palace.

21:12.799 --> 21:15.039
I fear that she wants to stay
in the palace for good.

21:15.039 --> 21:17.559
After all, that's much easier
than the Imperial Exam.

21:17.559 --> 21:18.559
He Du!

21:24.079 --> 21:25.079
Miss Meng.

21:28.680 --> 21:29.680
It's you.

21:30.640 --> 21:31.839
Where am I?

21:31.839 --> 21:32.839
Can you not see?

21:32.839 --> 21:34.119
This is the imperial palace.

21:35.359 --> 21:37.319
Right, I was just about to ask you,

21:37.319 --> 21:40.720
what exactly happened
between you and His Majesty in Shazhou?

21:40.720 --> 21:41.759
Chief Eunuch You,

21:41.759 --> 21:44.799
I heard His Majesty say he wanted some soup
as I was leaving.

21:44.799 --> 21:45.920
Hurry back and check on him.

21:46.880 --> 21:47.880
Alright.

21:52.039 --> 21:54.519
Miss Meng, you are finally awake.

21:54.519 --> 21:55.920
His Majesty saved you.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.480
You've been unconscious for two days,

21:57.480 --> 21:58.920
and your fever would not break.

21:58.920 --> 22:00.400
Are you feeling better now?

22:03.720 --> 22:06.480
The imperial physician prescribed this
to fortify you and clear the heat.

22:06.480 --> 22:07.519
Drink it while it is warm.

22:09.720 --> 22:11.400
<i>He is actually the emperor?</i>

22:14.119 --> 22:18.279
I never thought after that hurried meeting
at the exam hall entrance,

22:18.279 --> 22:20.519
we would meet again today in the palace.

22:21.559 --> 22:23.000
Thank you for taking care of me.

22:23.000 --> 22:24.119
No need for formalities.

22:25.000 --> 22:28.480
On the day of the Metropolitan Exam,
I thought I could win the top spot.

22:28.480 --> 22:30.319
I never imagined
there were greater peaks beyond.

22:30.319 --> 22:33.559
After reading your policy essay through,
I could not sleep at night,

22:33.559 --> 22:36.160
only hoping to meet the author soon.

22:36.160 --> 22:37.720
I never imagined it would be you, Miss Meng.

22:37.720 --> 22:39.160
I am truly delighted in my heart.

22:41.160 --> 22:44.400
Miss, do you know how Miss Yan is doing now?

22:44.400 --> 22:47.680
Rest assured, Miss Yan has been sent back
to Chunman House.

22:47.680 --> 22:48.680
All is well.

22:49.359 --> 22:50.359
Drink it while it is warm.

22:53.640 --> 22:55.160
Hearing what happened to you,

22:55.160 --> 22:56.799
I still feel lingering fear even now.

22:57.640 --> 23:01.039
Good thing you fought back so well,
so they did not succeed.

23:01.039 --> 23:02.400
Now it is all good.

23:02.400 --> 23:04.839
His Majesty not only
restored your title as Huiyuan

23:04.839 --> 23:06.680
but also threw Jiang Mei Er into prison.

23:06.680 --> 23:08.000
It is truly gratifying.

23:09.440 --> 23:11.559
Has His Majesty come by these days?

23:11.559 --> 23:12.599
Not yet.

23:12.599 --> 23:14.160
With such a huge matter happening,

23:14.160 --> 23:15.880
His Majesty is very busy.

23:15.880 --> 23:18.799
But he instructed me
to take good care of you.

23:18.799 --> 23:20.640
Then may I go and see His Majesty?

23:20.640 --> 23:22.359
You should rest and recover first.

23:22.359 --> 23:24.799
If there is anything,
I can help convey it for you.

23:24.799 --> 23:26.000
I want to go to the Ministry of Justice.

23:42.559 --> 23:43.559
Imperial Guard Huang.

23:44.960 --> 23:46.279
Imperial Guard Huang,

23:46.279 --> 23:47.839
I want to speak with her alone.

24:05.079 --> 24:08.319
Speak. How did you hook up with Lv,

24:08.319 --> 24:09.480
bribe the examiners,

24:10.119 --> 24:11.279
and set the fire to kill me?

24:12.279 --> 24:15.200
You are not much better than me.

24:16.559 --> 24:19.119
You're only standing here because you climbed

24:19.119 --> 24:20.680
onto His Majesty's bed.

24:21.480 --> 24:24.839
Without a man, you are nothing.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.000
Meng Ting Hui,

24:31.039 --> 24:33.079
you are still so arrogant

24:33.079 --> 24:34.960
and so self-righteous.

24:34.960 --> 24:36.839
Do you know what I hate most about you?

24:38.720 --> 24:40.440
It is those eyes of yours.

24:41.400 --> 24:44.240
You're merely a lowly wretch with no parents.

24:44.240 --> 24:46.160
What gives you the right
to look at me like that?

24:48.039 --> 24:52.359
I, Jiang Mei Er,
come from a prestigious family

24:52.359 --> 24:53.839
with stunning beauty.

24:55.759 --> 24:58.559
I could have had boundless glory.

25:00.160 --> 25:01.319
But you've ruined it all.

25:02.960 --> 25:07.759
You forced me... forced me to have no choice
but to eliminate you.

25:08.440 --> 25:11.079
To what extent do you want to destroy me?

25:11.079 --> 25:13.400
The one who destroyed you
has always been yourself.

25:14.599 --> 25:16.640
You acted lawlessly
because of your family background.

25:17.319 --> 25:19.039
You held power in your hands,

25:19.039 --> 25:21.079
yet all you did was oppress the innocent.

25:21.079 --> 25:23.880
It was your jealousy, greed, and obsession

25:23.880 --> 25:25.119
that pushed you into the abyss.

25:25.920 --> 25:29.519
Confess truthfully,
and your sentence may be reduced.

25:30.240 --> 25:32.559
But you only get one chance.

25:38.839 --> 25:42.559
Meng Ting Hui, do you dare say
you have no ambition?

25:43.359 --> 25:46.480
Do you dare say you do not want to climb up?

25:46.480 --> 25:48.799
Deep down, we are the same.

25:49.799 --> 25:53.559
You are just better at pretending than I am.

25:54.440 --> 25:56.839
Now you hypocritically say you will spare me?

25:57.759 --> 25:59.839
Do you even believe the nonsense yourself?

25:59.839 --> 26:02.039
We have never been the same.

26:03.000 --> 26:04.079
But you are right about one thing.

26:06.759 --> 26:08.759
I do want to climb up.

26:09.920 --> 26:13.319
And now, I have reached a position
where I can decide your fate.

26:14.480 --> 26:15.480
You won't write it?

26:16.839 --> 26:18.480
Since you do not want the chance,

26:20.039 --> 26:21.079
forget it.

26:28.319 --> 26:30.759
Meng Ting Hui, I will write it.

26:31.440 --> 26:32.799
I will write it.

26:32.799 --> 26:34.480
As long as you spare me,

26:34.480 --> 26:35.960
I will do anything.

26:42.319 --> 26:43.400
My mother said

26:44.079 --> 26:45.400
that I must survive.

26:47.359 --> 26:48.559
I must survive.

26:49.799 --> 26:52.992
Only by surviving can everything begin anew.

26:52.992 --> 26:56.512
[Condemned Woman Jiang Mei Er, Shazhou]

26:59.319 --> 27:00.839
I must survive.

27:02.720 --> 27:04.400
I must survive.

27:19.359 --> 27:21.200
The second-in-command of the Huxiao Gang,

27:21.880 --> 27:24.039
known as Second Master Lv.

27:24.039 --> 27:27.599
The Heihu Crew in Shazhou
was just a branch of the Huxiao Gang.

27:27.599 --> 27:28.599
I have confessed everything.

27:29.359 --> 27:31.079
You said the sentence would be reduced.

27:33.119 --> 27:34.119
Yes.

27:35.319 --> 27:38.839
Your heinous crimes
warranted death by a thousand cuts.

27:39.599 --> 27:41.839
His Majesty now grants you a swift death,

27:41.839 --> 27:43.200
which is already the greatest mercy.

27:44.319 --> 27:46.400
Meng Ting Hui!

27:46.400 --> 27:47.680
I was wrong!

27:47.680 --> 27:49.200
I was wrong!

27:49.200 --> 27:51.039
I beg you!

27:51.039 --> 27:53.440
I beg you! I beg you!

27:53.440 --> 27:54.960
- Jiang Mei Er.
- Spare me!

27:54.960 --> 27:58.160
I came today to send you off
on your final journey.

27:58.160 --> 28:00.599
Although I... although I have harmed you,

28:00.599 --> 28:04.480
aren't you standing here perfectly fine now?

28:04.480 --> 28:06.599
And you've even caught His Majesty's eye.

28:06.599 --> 28:10.039
Surely I deserve some credit
for your great fortune, don't I?

28:11.240 --> 28:14.880
The white silk or the poisoned wine.
Choose for yourself.

28:26.960 --> 28:29.599
Meng Ting Hui, you liar!

28:29.599 --> 28:31.279
You will die a terrible death!

28:31.279 --> 28:33.559
Huxiao Gang will not let you off!

28:33.559 --> 28:35.880
I will haunt you even as a ghost!

28:36.599 --> 28:38.680
I'm just worried they will not dare to come.

28:39.960 --> 28:41.279
For those who have harmed me,

28:43.039 --> 28:45.000
I will not let a single one of them go.

29:35.552 --> 29:38.521
[The Tiger's Roar Stirs the Wind]

30:09.400 --> 30:12.640
Are the women at Nuanxiang Pavilion
not enough for you?

30:12.640 --> 30:13.640
Master, I was wrong.

30:14.240 --> 30:15.559
Dong Shou Cai
has committed suicide out of fear.

30:15.559 --> 30:19.079
Rest assured. He didn't breathe a word
about us.

30:19.079 --> 30:20.079
Master.

30:23.640 --> 30:25.359
Brother. Brother.

30:25.359 --> 30:27.000
I was wrong, brother.

30:27.000 --> 30:28.119
Brother, I was truly wrong.

30:28.119 --> 30:29.119
Spare me, brother.

30:29.880 --> 30:30.880
Brother!

30:31.519 --> 30:33.160
Is this your first day in the business?

30:33.160 --> 30:35.039
That little wretch has already sold you out.

30:35.039 --> 30:37.839
Brother, I was truly blinded by that wretch.

30:37.839 --> 30:39.880
But my only thought was to find Meng Ting Hui

30:39.880 --> 30:41.039
to help vent Master's anger.

30:41.680 --> 30:42.680
Master...

30:42.680 --> 30:43.920
- Get up!
- Brother.

30:43.920 --> 30:45.319
Blinded by lust!

30:45.319 --> 30:46.720
Played for a fool!

30:46.720 --> 30:48.079
And you say you were helping Master?

30:48.920 --> 30:51.079
In life, fear no court official.

30:51.079 --> 30:52.880
In death, fear no King of Hell.

30:53.720 --> 30:54.720
Master.

30:54.720 --> 30:56.920
You are even more domineering than I am.

30:56.920 --> 30:58.799
Master, spare my life!

31:01.599 --> 31:03.000
Get over here!

31:03.000 --> 31:04.000
Brother!

31:06.079 --> 31:07.079
Brother!

31:07.079 --> 31:09.720
- I am your own brother!
- Shut up!

31:09.720 --> 31:10.880
I do not want to die!

31:10.880 --> 31:12.680
I am your own brother!

31:12.680 --> 31:14.480
Brother! Brother!

31:23.680 --> 31:24.759
Master,

31:24.759 --> 31:27.720
he'll carry this punishment with him.

31:27.720 --> 31:31.079
I beg you, Master,
just let him stay and continue serving

31:31.759 --> 31:33.079
to atone for his sins.

31:42.279 --> 31:45.119
It took our Huxiao Gang
ten years of hard work

31:46.400 --> 31:49.000
to build this foundation in the capital.

31:51.319 --> 31:53.359
Now, because of his actions alone,

31:54.759 --> 31:57.039
we are being hunted
by the entire city's soldiers,

31:57.039 --> 31:59.000
and it even alarmed His Majesty.

31:59.000 --> 32:01.039
If we did not have people in the court,

32:01.039 --> 32:03.279
the entire Huxiao Gang
would be buried with you!

32:03.279 --> 32:05.119
No, Master!

32:05.920 --> 32:07.480
I failed to teach him properly.

32:12.039 --> 32:13.279
Master,

32:13.279 --> 32:16.559
considering we've followed you
for over ten years,

32:16.559 --> 32:18.160
please spare his life.

32:18.160 --> 32:19.319
I beg you.

32:28.359 --> 32:30.160
Behave yourselves these days.

32:30.160 --> 32:31.599
Do not cause any more trouble.

32:31.599 --> 32:32.599
Yes.

32:32.599 --> 32:33.759
Thank you for sparing him.

32:33.759 --> 32:34.759
Get lost.

32:45.920 --> 32:49.984
[The imperial court is hunting Huxiao Gang.
Everyone must be extremely discreet]

33:20.720 --> 33:22.119
Master.

33:22.119 --> 33:23.119
Sit.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.200
Your brother...

33:31.200 --> 33:33.000
He is fine. Lost a chunk of flesh,

33:33.000 --> 33:34.000
but no damage to the bone.

33:34.000 --> 33:35.359
He'll live.

33:35.359 --> 33:36.519
Keep a tight watch on him.

33:36.519 --> 33:38.279
The imperial court is pressing hard.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.000
He has an impatient temper.

33:40.000 --> 33:43.759
If he stirs up trouble again,
he won't be so lucky.

33:43.759 --> 33:46.000
Rest assured, Master.
If he is this reckless again,

33:46.000 --> 33:48.279
no need for the gang rules.
I'll break his legs myself.

33:52.839 --> 33:54.079
I had Old Li make this for you.

33:55.519 --> 33:56.640
I do not know if it fits.

34:04.119 --> 34:05.240
Do not be so impulsive again.

34:18.440 --> 34:19.440
Miss Meng,

34:19.440 --> 34:21.440
you look much better than a few days ago.

34:21.440 --> 34:22.559
You still need more rest.

34:23.280 --> 34:26.920
I have rested for many days.
I want to go out for a walk.

34:28.039 --> 34:29.960
I've heard the Imperial Garden is stunning.

34:31.440 --> 34:33.719
Does His Majesty often go there?

34:34.519 --> 34:36.280
In his spare time after reviewing memorials,

34:36.280 --> 34:37.800
he occasionally takes a brief rest there.

34:42.840 --> 34:45.199
Miss Meng, I'll take my leave.

34:50.079 --> 34:51.599
<i>My body has already recovered.</i>

34:52.719 --> 34:53.960
<i>The Palace Exam is coming soon.</i>

34:54.880 --> 34:56.840
<i>I must seize the opportunity before me.</i>

35:02.079 --> 35:03.840
This was my mother's favorite flower.

35:06.360 --> 35:07.360
What a pity.

35:08.559 --> 35:10.199
Rotten soil nurtures no good flowers.

35:11.360 --> 35:14.519
Huang Bo, go and get another new seedling.

35:14.519 --> 35:15.519
Yes.

35:30.400 --> 35:33.519
Grand Tutor, I summoned you today
to discuss a matter.

35:34.480 --> 35:36.400
I wish to establish the Censorate,

35:36.400 --> 35:38.079
independent from the two chancellors
and six ministries.

35:38.079 --> 35:39.519
Above, it can supervise all officials,

35:39.519 --> 35:40.920
and below, it can eradicate evil,

35:40.920 --> 35:42.039
reporting directly to my ear.

35:43.920 --> 35:44.920
Your Majesty.

35:45.719 --> 35:46.719
Here.

35:50.199 --> 35:52.199
If Your Majesty wishes
to cultivate new talent,

35:53.559 --> 35:55.599
although these young seedlings
are free of pests,

35:55.599 --> 35:58.760
their roots are too shallow
to weather the storm.

36:06.000 --> 36:07.079
<i>The Censorate?</i>

36:08.000 --> 36:10.960
Is Huiyuan Meng still recuperating
in the palace?

36:10.960 --> 36:13.119
Of course. His Majesty feels for beauty.

36:13.119 --> 36:14.719
With imperial physicians and tonics,

36:14.719 --> 36:16.320
one could say it is the utmost care.

36:22.519 --> 36:25.519
Now, Lord Xu is watching
the fallout from the Imperial Exam for Women.

36:25.519 --> 36:27.960
Now Your Majesty brings Huiyuan Meng back.
I'm afraid...

36:27.960 --> 36:31.519
Bringing in new scholars
is meant to counter Lord Xu.

36:33.360 --> 36:37.239
It was the Ministry of Rites' negligence
that caused Huiyuan Meng such suffering.

36:37.239 --> 36:38.519
The Palace Exam is imminent.

36:38.519 --> 36:40.960
I am merely hoping she can recover soon

36:40.960 --> 36:42.320
and prepare with peace of mind.

36:44.400 --> 36:45.599
Your Majesty,

36:45.599 --> 36:48.440
if Huiyuan Meng stays in the palace too long,
it will invite gossip.

36:49.239 --> 36:51.480
Lord Xu's faction is eyeing us covetously.

36:52.440 --> 36:56.440
If they make a big fuss over this,
it may harm Your Majesty's name.

36:56.440 --> 36:58.480
It'll also jeopardize Miss Meng's future.

37:04.079 --> 37:05.800
You are absolutely right.

37:05.800 --> 37:08.559
Then summon the imperial physician
to examine Huiyuan Meng again.

37:08.559 --> 37:10.880
If she's well,
send her out of the palace immediately.

38:02.239 --> 38:03.559
The world is dark and murky,

38:04.679 --> 38:05.800
and the night is endless.

38:12.440 --> 38:13.800
The heavens are unkind,

38:15.480 --> 38:17.079
and tears wet my robes.

38:17.079 --> 38:19.400
Your Majesty, should I stop her?

38:20.119 --> 38:21.360
Let her vent.

38:26.599 --> 38:28.159
Fierce winds and sudden rain,

38:28.840 --> 38:30.320
what is there to fear?

38:31.880 --> 38:35.559
I shall be the sword that slays the fiends.

38:38.280 --> 38:39.280
Huiyuan Meng's temperament

38:39.280 --> 38:40.760
carries the wildness of the Shazhou people.

38:40.760 --> 38:43.880
Your Majesty did not see,
but she was formidable in interrogation too.

38:43.880 --> 38:45.480
In just a moment, Jiang Mei Er confessed.

38:45.480 --> 38:47.239
She is never simple to begin with.

38:47.239 --> 38:51.000
This blow will only make her
more resolute and unhesitating.

38:53.159 --> 38:54.159
Her next step

38:55.800 --> 38:58.800
will be to find herself
a tree to lean on, I suppose.

38:59.440 --> 39:02.519
Your Majesty,
Huiyuan Meng has just recovered.

39:02.519 --> 39:04.159
If she gets rained on, she might fall ill

39:04.159 --> 39:05.880
and miss the Palace Exam.

39:05.880 --> 39:08.400
How about I take Huiyuan Meng back first?

39:23.320 --> 39:25.159
Why torture yourself?

39:30.000 --> 39:31.400
He Du.

39:39.480 --> 39:40.519
Your Majesty, rest assured,

39:41.199 --> 39:44.639
Huiyuan Meng just caught a chill.
It's nothing serious.

39:44.639 --> 39:45.800
Once she sobers up,

39:45.800 --> 39:48.079
a dose of cold medicine will cure her.

39:48.079 --> 39:49.519
You may leave now.

39:49.519 --> 39:50.519
Yes.

39:56.719 --> 39:57.800
Your Majesty,

39:57.800 --> 39:58.840
since she's fine,

39:58.840 --> 40:01.280
we should head back now,
as it's getting late.

40:07.360 --> 40:08.360
He Du.

40:25.920 --> 40:27.000
No need for formalities.

40:28.880 --> 40:31.360
No, you are the emperor.

40:32.440 --> 40:33.719
I must pay my respects.

40:36.280 --> 40:38.800
Greetings, Your Majesty.

40:44.760 --> 40:46.159
You may leave for now.

40:46.159 --> 40:48.039
- Your Majesty--
- I know what I'm doing.

41:06.639 --> 41:11.199
I never imagined that He Du,
the one who faced death with me in Shazhou,

41:13.039 --> 41:14.639
would actually be the emperor.

41:15.960 --> 41:17.599
That day at the Capital Prefectural Office,

41:17.599 --> 41:19.400
if Your Majesty had not appeared in time,

41:20.039 --> 41:24.360
I'm afraid
I wouldn't even be left in one piece.

41:36.840 --> 41:39.159
Thank you, Your Majesty, for saving my life.

41:39.159 --> 41:42.559
I do not know how to repay you.

41:53.519 --> 41:55.000
The Imperial Exam fraud

41:55.000 --> 41:56.360
and the Ministry of Rites' negligence

41:56.360 --> 41:57.960
are my failing.

41:57.960 --> 41:59.639
You have suffered.

41:59.639 --> 42:01.000
If you truly wish to repay me,

42:01.679 --> 42:04.360
do not ruin your own health any longer.

42:04.360 --> 42:05.760
Do well in the exam.

42:05.760 --> 42:10.800
I remember in Shazhou,
Your Majesty gave me a chance,

42:10.800 --> 42:13.360
but I rejected Your Majesty's kind offer.

42:14.559 --> 42:16.079
Now I understand.

42:16.079 --> 42:17.840
In this man-eat-man world,

42:17.840 --> 42:20.880
being aloof and righteous
can cost one their life.

42:21.679 --> 42:23.159
I am so afraid,

42:23.159 --> 42:27.519
afraid that one day, even Your Majesty
will not be able to protect me.
